  "id": "the-fog-city-mysteries-in-color",
  "title": "The Fog City Mysteries: IN COLOR!",
  "subtitle": "A full-cast comedy noir",
  "description": "A podcast comedy noir unlike any other ... In a fog-bound metropolis that never was, radio detective Harding Park untangles crimes and conspiracies, scandals and secrets, and keeps a watchful eye on the poultry. Full cast, full sound, and packed with absurdist style, Fog City blends old-school radio theatre vibes with sharp satire and shadowy intrigue. Imagine this: The Maltese Falcon, The Streets of San Francisco, Bojack Horseman, The Twilight Zone, and The Hitchhiker’s Guide to the Galaxy — all trapped together on a gondola ... with a duck.",
